3. Wallet custody options
We should choose one custody model before implementation.

Option	Benefit	Risk
Browser wallet + signer	Clear user custody and consent	Limited automation; wallet must remain connected and capable of signing
Session/scoped smart account	Automated policy-controlled trades	More complex key and recovery design
Server-held trading wallet	Smooth automation	Highest custody, compromise, and regulatory risk
Delegated exchange account	Provider-native automation	Requires carefully scoped provider credentials and withdrawal restrictions
